{"page":"AKAP9","gene":"AKAP9","accession":"Q99996","protein":"A-kinase anchor protein 9","length":3907,"events":["Alternative splicing"],"canonical":{"accession":"Q99996-2","name":"2","synonyms":[],"notes":[],"transcripts":{"ensembl":["ENST00000356239.8"],"refseq":["NM_005751.5"],"refseqProteins":["NP_005742.4"],"maneSelect":true,"decay":[],"onlyDecay":false},"model":null},"features":[{"type":"Coiled coil","start":152,"end":902,"description":""},{"type":"Modified residue","start":153,"end":153,"description":"Phosphoserine"},{"type":"Coiled coil","start":932,"end":1010,"description":""},{"type":"Coiled coil","start":1088,"end":1173,"description":""},{"type":"Coiled coil","start":1241,"end":1268,"description":""},{"type":"Coiled coil","start":1324,"end":1380,"description":""},{"type":"Modified residue","start":1327,"end":1327,"description":"Phosphoserine"},{"type":"Coiled coil","start":1422,"end":1447,"description":""},{"type":"Coiled coil","start":1573,"end":1647,"description":""},{"type":"Modified residue","start":1765,"end":1765,"description":"Phosphoserine"},{"type":"Coiled coil","start":1845,"end":2443,"description":""},{"type":"Coiled coil","start":2532,"end":2549,"description":""},{"type":"Region","start":2542,"end":2555,"description":"PKA-RII subunit binding domain"},{"type":"Coiled coil","start":2591,"end":2764,"description":""},{"type":"Coiled coil","start":3061,"end":3088,"description":""},{"type":"Coiled coil","start":3120,"end":3466,"description":""},{"type":"Coiled coil","start":3583,"end":3685,"description":""},{"type":"Modified residue","start":3690,"end":3690,"description":"Phosphoserine"},{"type":"Modified residue","start":3842,"end":3842,"description":"Phosphoserine"},{"type":"Modified residue","start":3865,"end":3865,"description":"Phosphoserine"},{"type":"Modified residue","start":3897,"end":3897,"description":"Phosphoserine"}],"interfaces":{},"subunit":[{"topic":"Subunit","text":"Interacts with the regulatory region of protein kinase N (PKN), protein phosphatase 2A (PP2A), protein phosphatase 1 (PP1) and the immature non-phosphorylated form of PKC epsilon. Interacts with CIP4 and FNBP1 (PubMed:15047863). Interacts with chloride intracellular channel proteins CLIC1, CLIC4 and CLIC5 (PubMed:12163479). CSNK1D binding promotes its centrosomal subcellular location (PubMed:12270714). Interacts with GM130/GOLGA2; leading to recruitment to the Golgi apparatus (PubMed:19242490). Interacts with KCNQ1; targets protein kinase A (PKA) catalytic and regulatory subunits and protein phosphatase 1 (PP1), to the heterodimer KCNQ1-KCNE1 (PubMed:11799244). Interacts with PDE4DIP isoform 13/MMG8/SMYLE; this interaction stabilizes both proteins (PubMed:25217626, PubMed:27666745, PubMed:28814570). In complex with PDE4DIP isoform 13, recruits CAMSAP2 to the Golgi apparatus (PubMed:27666745, PubMed:28814570). Forms a pericentrosomal complex with CDK5RAP2, EB1/MAPRE1 and PDE4DIP isoform 13; within this complex, MAPRE1 binding to CDK5RAP2 may be mediated by PDE4DIP (PubMed:29162697). Interacts with MAPRE1 and MAPRE3 (PubMed:28814570). Interacts (via C-terminus) with CAMSAP2; this interaction is much stronger in the presence of PDE4DIP isoform 13/MMG8/SMYLE (PubMed:27666745). Interacts with CAMSAP3 (PubMed:28089391). Interacts (via C-terminus) with the gamma-tubulin ring complex (gamma-TuRC), composed of gamma-tubulin, TUBGCP2, TUBGCP3, TUBGCP4, TUBGCP5 and TUBGCP6 (PubMed:27666745)"}],"isoforms":[{"accession":"Q99996-1","name":"1","synonyms":[],"notes":[],"length":3911,"transcripts":{"ensembl":[],"refseq":[],"refseqProteins":[],"maneSelect":false,"decay":[],"onlyDecay":false},"segments":[[1,1,16],[29,17,2866],[2908,2904,1004]],"edits":[{"start":16,"end":16,"original":"K","replacement":"KIEELSLAFLVRQ","added":13},{"start":2883,"end":2903,"original":"GSSIPELAHSDAYQTREICSS","replacement":"VFGFYNMCFSTLC","added":13}],"missing":0,"replaced":21,"novel":25,"foldedAbsent":null,"foldedMissing":null,"features":[],"interfaces":{},"model":null}